[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2593908317","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861#issuecomment-2593908317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861","id":2593908317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6am-Zd","user":{"login":"mfschubert","id":30735893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM1ODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30735893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert","html_url":"https://github.com/mfschubert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T20:50:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T20:50:14Z","body":"This has a similar \"flavor\" to the jax hanging issues I reported here: https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/24255. For example, I notice we are both using callbacks.\n\nAlthough I identified a workaround in that case, I still regularly encounter jax hanging. In particular, it occurs for the test suite for the invrs-gym package (https://github.com/invrs-io/gym) for versions of jax that are 0.4.31 and newer.\n\nA few runs of @roth-jakob 's script also suggest that the issue does not exist at least for jax 0.4.30","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2593908317/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2594805734","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861#issuecomment-2594805734","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861","id":2594805734,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6aqZfm","user":{"login":"roth-jakob","id":144361938,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJrJ0g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144361938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob","html_url":"https://github.com/roth-jakob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-16T08:23:13Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T08:23:13Z","body":"Thanks for the input! Yes, this seems related. As for the code snipped above, also for the example in #24255, the JAX haning issues seem to come from JAX asynchronous dispatching. By setting `jax.config.update('jax_cpu_enable_async_dispatch', False)` also the example of #24255 also runs without hanging.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2594805734/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2598392376","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861#issuecomment-2598392376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861","id":2598392376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6a4FI4","user":{"login":"PhilipVinc","id":2407108,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDcxMDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2407108?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc","html_url":"https://github.com/PhilipVinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T13:40:44Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T13:40:44Z","body":"I also see regular hangs in our pytest suite running on CPU, which are solved by disabling asynchronous dispatch.\nI never managed to identify the root cause, however.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2598392376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2598743789","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861#issuecomment-2598743789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861","id":2598743789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6a5a7t","user":{"login":"hawkinsp","id":348932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T16:35:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T16:35:14Z","body":"Well, what's happening here is that your callback is calling back *into* JAX to dispatch a JAX computation. It's this one: `i == maxiter:`.\n\nIf you change your code to do this:\n```\n    if maxiter is not None and np.asarray(i) == np.asarray(maxiter):\n```\nit will not hang.\n\nNow I admit this is not a great behavior. This should either work or give a loud error.\n\n@dfm @danielsuo ?","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2598743789/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2598793538","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861#issuecomment-2598793538","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861","id":2598793538,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6a5nFC","user":{"login":"roth-jakob","id":144361938,"node_id":"U_kgDOCJrJ0g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/144361938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob","html_url":"https://github.com/roth-jakob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roth-jakob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T17:00:05Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T17:00:05Z","body":"Many thanks for the explanation!\n\nAn error message would of course be great. Otherwise, a warning in the docstring of the [callback](https://jax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/_autosummary/jax.debug.callback.html#jax.debug.callback) not to call back into JAX could also help.  ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2598793538/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2598806167","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861#issuecomment-2598806167","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861","id":2598806167,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6a5qKX","user":{"login":"dfm","id":350282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDI4Mg==","avatar_url":"htt