:"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T20:12:31Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T20:12:31Z","body":"> FYI, I am finding that Jax can hang even in cases where callback is entirely avoided. Specifically, it occurs when running the invrs-gym test suite via pytest. So, there may be another issue besides the callback-related one.\n\nIt would probably be helpful to have a reproducer for that one, ideally the smallest you can. The repro in this issue is great because it's very short and easy to run.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2599117094/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2599117671","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861#issuecomment-2599117671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861","id":2599117671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6a62Nn","user":{"login":"hawkinsp","id":348932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T20:12:59Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T20:12:59Z","body":"> [@hawkinsp](https://github.com/hawkinsp) is there a relatively easy way to identify this kind of error in a large codebase? Is there an easy way to throw an error if I'm using `jnp.asarray`or similar functions inside of a callback?\n\nI think the easiest thing would be if we added an error if you called into the jit or pmap dispatch paths from within a callback. It would then be obvious to you!","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2599117671/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2599219956","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861#issuecomment-2599219956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861","id":2599219956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6a7PL0","user":{"login":"mfschubert","id":30735893,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM1ODkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30735893?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert","html_url":"https://github.com/mfschubert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfschubert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T21:08:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T21:08:53Z","body":"> > FYI, I am finding that Jax can hang even in cases where callback is entirely avoided. Specifically, it occurs when running the invrs-gym test suite via pytest. So, there may be another issue besides the callback-related one.\n> \n> It would probably be helpful to have a reproducer for that one, ideally the smallest you can. The repro in this issue is great because it's very short and easy to run.\n\nOk, I may have actually spoken too soon. There is a callback in a dependency that I oversaw (in [agjax](https://github.com/mfschubert/agjax)), which at a minimum is making use of `jax.tree_util`. I suppose this would also cause the issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2599219956/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2621877646","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861#issuecomment-2621877646","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/25861","id":2621877646,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6cRq2O","user":{"login":"dfm","id":350282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MDI4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/350282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfm","html_url":"https://github.com/dfm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-29T14:53:35Z","updated_at":"2025-01-29T14:53:35Z","body":"This was fixed in https://github.com/openxla/xla/pull/21980, with a test added in https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/26160. Take a look at those PRs for more details about the approach, but the basic approach is to just disable asynchronous dispatch on CPU when the program includes callbacks. These changes will be included in the next JAX release. In the meantime, disabling async dispatch manually will give the same behavior.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2621877646/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]